{"episode_id": "acc55d14-238f-5700-8d05-78295cd885fc", "summary": "meme-benchmark further explored how to convey the Zaptec charging solution to the installer and end customer. The assistant suggested creating a detailed written proposal with technical specs, cost estimates, and timelines; offering visual presentations with schematics; scheduling meetings for interactive discussions; and providing product datasheets and manuals. For connection method and installation, the assistant recommended using a Dynamic Load Management (DLM) system configured to distribute power dynamically among stations based on demand and priority, with proper grounding and compliance with safety regulations. For load and phase balancing, the assistant advised identifying power supply and phases, using chargers with built-in balancing, configuring communication among chargers, setting user priorities, and monitoring the system regularly to optimize power distribution.", "new_developments": [], "updates": [], "unresolved": [], "source_message_count": 2, "first_message_at": "2023-03-19T23:26:00+00:00", "last_message_at": "2023-03-19T23:26:00+00:00", "entities": [], "relationships": [], "events": [], "evidence": [], "sources_consulted": [], "similarity": 0.5056132680908761}

